    "testimonials_v2_qaP8YT": {
      "type": "testimonials-v2",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_RYBD9T": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "review_content": "<h4>Before establishing our orchard, we talked to most major truffle companies in the US. There’s a reason we chose ATC. While everyone else was happy to sell us their trees and leave us to our own devices, ATC has been there for us every step of the way, along with their deep expertise. When ATC says your success is their success, they really mean it! I cannot recommend ATC highly enough.</h4>",
            "author_name": "EVAN,",
            "author_description": "Southern Tennessee"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_feHQkN": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "review_content": "<h4>After a failed 2018 truffle project with another company that left me with trees that were no longer viable and no access to truffle expertise nor real science—I was eager to partner with ATC. They brought rigorous, science-based guidance to every step of our new project. Their technical precision and attention to detail were critical to establishing a thriving truffle orchard across our five-acre site, and gave us strong confidence in a far more successful outcome.</h4>",
            "author_name": "MARK,",
            "author_description": "Central Oregon"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_aXrTgc": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "review_content": "<h4>I really appreciate the responsiveness of ATC to answer all questions and work to resolve any issue that comes up<strong>—</strong>especially at a time when it is hard to get a live person to speak with at many companies. Robert, Paul & Peta are true collaborators, with a wealth of expertise. The ATC model shows skin in the game; if you succeed, they succeed. </h4>",
            "author_name": "CAROL, Manzanita Grove Vineyard,",
            "author_description": "Sonoma CA"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_LMkFGC": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "review_content": "<h4>ATC’s business model is unique and exemplary. I have worked with ATC for many years, throughout which they have helped me at every turn, while proactively staying closely involved. I could not be more pleased!</h4>",
            "author_name": "CHARLES, Eagle Crest Farms LLC,",
            "author_description": "Pacific Northwest"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_GV94AX": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "review_content": "<h4>ATC's science-first approach is essential for a 30+ year commitment. They give me confidence to mitigate risk and navigate the immense complexity from orchard planning through planting. Their invaluable support transforms a high-risk venture into a disciplined project. Robert's regular check-ins also clarify local and global market realities, answering my many questions along the way. Partnering with ATC isn’t just farming—it’s a strategic investment in a growing market.</h4>",
            "author_name": "CHRIS,",
            "author_description": "Central Missouri"
          }
        }
      },
